       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_dkn_161'), 2, 'Look at whether `proxy_pass` has anything after host:port, and at which levels `proxy_set_header` appears.'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_dkn_161'), 3, 'Same rule on a different path: with `location /static/ { proxy_pass http://cdn/files/; }`, a request for `/static/logo.png` reaches cdn as `/files/logo.png`.');
