       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_dkn_181'), 2, 'Look at the order of the lines in each log, and at what nginx does with a configuration it cannot load.'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_dkn_181'), 3, 'Same idea with a different service: a payments worker pool where new workers start on the new config, old workers keep their in-flight jobs and exit when done; if the new config fails to load, the pool keeps running the old one.');
